PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  <Input> + lucide Search        → CommandSearchField: SF Symbol "magnifyingglass" + TextField(prompt) + clear "xmark.circle.fill"
  placeholder commands.search.placeholder → TextField prompt (P1/S10), un-elided form is the VoiceOver field label
  parent COMMANDS.filter(q)      → CommandSearchProjector.project (title.lowercased().contains || category.contains
                                    || command.contains), needle = query.lowercased() (untrimmed, like web), catalog order, no cap
  !search.trim() → null          → CommandSearchProjector.isSearching guard → .idle phase (informative hint, never blank)
  commands.search.noResults      → CommandSearchEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView)
  isLoading                      → .loading ; query error → .error + retry (QueryError intent)
  isStale / commands.staleData   → freshness chip + stale banner; CommandSearchAge formats the {{age}} from updatedAt
  isAsleep / wake-first          → offline chip + banner
  token chrome                   → Color.TS.* / Font.TS.* / TSSpacing / TSRadius (P1/S9); zero inline hex, zero raw text-white/N
  i18n                           → every string via CommandSearchStrings facade; zero English literals in Swift
  a11y                           → field + clear + every match row + retry + chips/banners carry labels;
                                    decorative glyphs .accessibilityHidden(true); result area exposes a spoken phase summary
  telemetry                      → view.opened surface="CommandSearch" once on appear (P1/S11), default OSLog sink

STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces; verified in previews + model tests)
  idle (empty box) · loading · content (matches) · empty (no matches) · error (+retry) · stale (chip+banner+auto-refresh)
  · offline (cached catalog + wake-first banner). Stale auto-refreshes exactly once until live; offline keeps cache.

